  "about": {
    "zh": "一个 Q 版动漫少女,一只白色的小龙,二头半身,正面站着;带一点淡紫的白色波浪长发垂到膝盖,头顶一根呆毛,两只带棱纹的白色大龙角,尖尖的精灵耳,头一侧别着白色绳结编的花饰、垂着流苏;淡紫色眼睛;穿白色无袖连衣裙,配一对分开的白色荷叶边长袖(袖口宽大,垂过双手),身上点缀着绳结和流苏,白色鞋子;背后一对淡紫色的蝙蝠样龙翼,一条粗粗的白色鳞片龙尾从身后弯到一侧;平时双手自然垂着,话少,神情清冷",
    "en": "a chibi anime girl, a little white dragon, two and a half heads tall, standing facing front; very long wavy white hair with a faint lavender tint falling to her knees, an ahoge, two large ribbed white dragon horns, pointed elf ears, a white knotted-cord flower ornament with a hanging tassel on one side of her head; lavender eyes; a white sleeveless dress with long detached white frilled sleeves, wide and hanging past her hands, knotted ornaments and tassels, and white shoes; two pale lavender bat-like dragon wings behind her and a thick white scaled dragon tail curling out to one side; her arms usually just hang; cool, quiet and terse"
  },
